        <object id="notes" label="&lt;b&gt;Gaps (not drawn):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Networking: no VNet, subnets or private endpoints are stated; every service is public (private networking is Deferred in the spine). Which services must move behind private endpoints before real data?&lt;br&gt;• Secrets: the spine keeps secrets in Container Apps secrets, but Key Vault is Deferred; where will secrets live beyond the POC?&lt;br&gt;• Environments: only one &amp;#x27;demo&amp;#x27; environment; dev/test/prod separation isn&amp;#x27;t stated.&lt;br&gt;• Failover region and backups beyond the PostgreSQL Flexible Server defaults are not stated (Deferred).&lt;br&gt;• No official Azure icon for Microsoft Foundry: the Foundry group uses the AI Studio (former name) stencil, and the hosted agent is a plain box.&lt;br&gt;• AD-20 places the feedback job in the foundation stack but does not name its Container Apps environment; it is drawn in the only environment the spine has. Is that the one?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each element's source is in grey under its name and in its tooltip.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Arrow colour shows where the arrow goes: every arrow into the same element has that element's colour.">
